The first time through the lab, I chose to use the 
database tables in their existing format and modify
the data types using Pandas.

This version is called PANDAS_clean. After cleaning
in Pandas, some graphs are made using Matplotlib.

The SQL_clean version of the lab reformats the data 
types using SQL, allowing for more overall use of
SQL in the project.

The FINAL verison of the lab encorporates all of 
the best lessons from the first two runs through 
the lab, this time focusing on a written data 
analysis for the purpose of course final testing.

